title: what it is
pid: c6e78f74-aba7-4be9-bb17-c13c4f36f9fc
body: |2-
  If an atom from a skgrepo
  has been deleted since that skgrepo's latest commit,
  a 'resurrected deletion' can still show
  its title, body and content.
  Those data could be part of the ephemeral data store,
  or they could be deduced from the git history.
